    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, delve and conquer the boundless wilds of Faercana! A retro throwback to classic ARPGs, Myth &amp; Magery invites you to switch off and sink into long sessions of slime-splattering, dungeon-diving and wand-waving as you seek to uncover the mysteries of the Chitin!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Side-quest forever!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u274cRescue the princess and prevent the apocalypse?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2714\ufe0fHelp Farmer Bob find his lost sheep!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound familiar? With endless procedural content and no &quot;main quest&quot; looming over our chosen hero, you can go side-questing guilt-free!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Delve, loot, slay, repeat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The subterranean labyrinths of the ancients have become home to many horrors, but treasures await to be claimed by the bold...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abracadabra!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a master of the arcane arts with in-depth, systems-driven spell- and wand-crafting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare for battle, in style!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient relics, monster hides, enchanted gemstones - craft and tailor your gear for the challenges that await, and look cool doing it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless procedural landscapes, dungeons and quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear that actually appears on your character sprite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft bespoke wands, spells, potions, food, clothes, trinkets, arms and armour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down action combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite gameplay</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, delve and conquer the boundless wilds of Faercana! A retro throwback to classic ARPGs, Myth &amp; Magery invites you to switch off and sink into long sessions of slime-splattering, dungeon-diving and wand-waving as you seek to uncover the mysteries of the Chitin!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Side-quest forever!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u274cRescue the princess and prevent the apocalypse?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2714\ufe0fHelp Farmer Bob find his lost sheep!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound familiar? With endless procedural content and no &quot;main quest&quot; looming over our chosen hero, you can go side-questing guilt-free!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Delve, loot, slay, repeat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The subterranean labyrinths of the ancients have become home to many horrors, but treasures await to be claimed by the bold...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abracadabra!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a master of the arcane arts with in-depth, systems-driven spell- and wand-crafting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare for battle, in style!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient relics, monster hides, enchanted gemstones - craft and tailor your gear for the challenges that await, and look cool doing it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless procedural landscapes, dungeons and quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear that actually appears on your character sprite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft bespoke wands, spells, potions, food, clothes, trinkets, arms and armour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down action combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite gameplay</p></li></ul>",
